## Data license — `data/source/route_shapes.json`

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository.

**`data/source/route_shapes.json` is not MIT.** It is derived from OpenStreetMap and is
licensed under the **Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0**:

    © OpenStreetMap contributors — https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The file was produced by routing over a Geofabrik South Korea extract with OSRM
(see `docs/adr/0009-route-shape-from-osrm.md` and `data/README.md`). ODbL requires
attribution and share-alike for the database and its derivatives; the map screens carry
the attribution in the map corner.

이 저장소의 **코드는 MIT**이고, **`data/source/route_shapes.json` 한 파일만 ODbL**입니다.
귀속 문구는 화면의 지도 모서리에 있습니다.
